# Build context for apps/web/Dockerfile (the repository root). Only the web app and the lockfile.
# The API image uses backend/ as its context, with backend/.dockerignore.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!apps/web/
apps/web/node_modules/
apps/web/.next/
apps/web/coverage/
apps/web/*.tsbuildinfo
apps/web/next-env.d.ts
apps/web/Dockerfile
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
